{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23793","headline":"咏家醖十韵 · 白居易","name":"咏家醖十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独醒从古笑灵均，长醉如今斅伯伦。\n旧法依稀传自杜，新方要妙得於陈。\n井泉王相资重九，麴糵精灵用上寅。\n酿糯岂劳炊范黍，撇篘何假漉陶巾。\n常嫌竹叶犹凡浊，始觉榴花不正真。\n瓮揭开时香酷烈，缾封贮後味甘辛。\n捧疑明水从空化，饮似阳和满腹春。\n色洞玉壶无表里，光摇金醆有精神。\n能销忙事成闲事，转得忧人作乐人。\n应是世间贤圣物，与君还往拟终身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}